  m_text: '<style=H1>Turn Rules</style>


    During a single turn, you may <style=blueColor><b>Measure</b></style>,
    or <style=blueColor><b>Attack</b></style>.


    After performing one of these
    actions, the other action becomes disabled. You must perform at least one action
    before ending your turn.



    To end your turn, click: <sprite name=next_player>



    The
    turn is then passed to the other player.'
