  m_text: "<b>Original Board Game Author</b>:\nMgr. Jana Legersk\xE1\n\n<b>Scientific
    Consultant</b>:\nRNDr. Zde\u0148ka Koupilov\xE1, Ph.D.\n\n<b>Game Designer \xB7
    Programmer \xB7 Graphics Designer \xB7 Developer \xB7 Tester</b>:\nMat\u011Bj
    Marou\u0161ek\n\n<b>Testers</b>:\nJi\u0159\xED Pinkas, Jan Kratochv\xEDl\n\n<b>Special
    Thanks</b>:\n<style=Bullet>Mgr. Jana Legersk\xE1 \u2014 for giving the opportunity
    to create the digital version</style>\n<style=Bullet>RNDr. Tom\xE1\u0161 Holan,
    Ph.D. \u2013 for providing the opportunity to create this game</style>\r\n<style=Bullet>RNDr.
    Zde\u0148ka Koupilov\xE1, Ph.D. \u2014 for motivation to complete the game and
    support its future use</style>\n<style=Bullet>Luk\xE1\u0161 Krkavec \u2014 for
    many great ideas to improve the game</style>\n\n<b>Game</b>: \n<color=#F54927><link=\"https://github.com/M4thys02/Quantum-ships\">GitHub
    Repository</link></color>"
